#: 94bdf437319445e4b11e6a87020b63c9
msgid "**ARCHIVED: no longer supported**"
msgstr "**已归档：不再支持**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:7
#: b44b7c8bad964f94809bf0c03cf7109b
msgid "Toshiba CAN ESCs"
msgstr "Toshiba CAN 电调"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:12
#: 74ead852618e4022a517ef4ef95c95d3
msgid ""
"ToshibaCAN ESCs are high-end ESCs that allow control and feedback using a"
" custom CAN protocol.  Some additional specifications:"
msgstr "ToshibaCAN 电调是高端电调，通过自定义 CAN 协议进行控制和反馈。部分附加规格："

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:14
#: 42f9252e857d4965a23bf406d2e1c0ff
#, python-format
msgid ""
"FOC which should result in about 10% longer flight times while also being"
" quieter than non-FOC ESCs"
msgstr "FOC 控制，飞行时间比非 FOC 电调延长约 10%，同时噪音更小"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:15
#: 5deb32e89a5540fea5d1c751217f328e
msgid "Up to 7S batteries (future versions are planned for up to 12S), 50Amps"
msgstr "最高支持 7S 电池（未来版本计划支持最高 12S），50A"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:16
#: b8596e3e9c3c4b28a66563ca1ef19b89
msgid "Up to 12 motors"
msgstr "最多支持 12 个电机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:17
#: db93ea4959d647689dd4da5b7281474d
msgid "Fast sync issue recovery time (100ms to 150ms)"
msgstr "快速同步问题恢复时间（100ms 至 150ms）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:18
#: fde0357b715848bbbdfb716f54e66372
msgid "Relatively lightweight"
msgstr "相对轻量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:19
#: cef8379b39754a07be23e0e9f1e2fe8e
msgid "Designed and manufactured in Japan"
msgstr "在日本设计制造"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:23
#: c3a296cbd5c9412eb4b181f19a12d9e7
msgid ""
"Support for these ESCs is included in Copter-4.0 (and higher), Plane-3.10"
" (and higher) and Rover-3.5 (and higher)"
msgstr "Copter-4.0（及更高版本）、Plane-3.10（及更高版本）和 Rover-3.5（及更高版本）支持这些电调"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:26
#: c37159b84c0d4facb9a2ade35be34e5b
msgid "Where To Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:28
#: 9d33916110094f09b4c3a1ec92fd52de
msgid ""
"These ESCs can be purchased by directly contacting the following "
"companies (replace \"AT\" with \"@\" in the email addresses)"
msgstr "这些电调可直接联系以下公司购买（将邮件地址中的「AT」替换为「@」）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:30
#: d13cd6f5293d463c90f113e83b3de720
msgid "Toshiba USA: Alan.Li AT taec.toshiba.com"
msgstr "Toshiba 美国：Alan.Li AT taec.toshiba.com"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:31
#: e298e50abeb84a48a06a556797bdb91b
msgid "Hikari Alphax Japan: masaki_nakamura AT h-ax.com"
msgstr "Hikari Alphax 日本：masaki_nakamura AT h-ax.com"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:33
#: 4849789c1249417aaf1cbf558437c475
msgid ""
"CAN splitter boards are also required, the boards used in the above video"
" were provided by `EAMS Lab <http://elab.co.jp/>`__ but these are also "
"not readily available for sale."
msgstr ""
"还需要 CAN 分线板，上述视频中使用的分线板由 `EAMS Lab <http://elab.co.jp/>`__ "
"提供，但这些板子也无法轻易购买到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:36
#: f28d591901a748d69a8ccaaccc7d3015
msgid "Connection and Configuration"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:42
#: 1b8aa1a9b4554f6a9c99824c73e359fd
msgid ""
"ESCs should be daisy chained together using CAN splitter boards and then "
"one 4-pin CAN cable should be connected to the autopilot's CAN port.  "
"Note that the last splitter board has a terminator (i.e. no port) on one "
"side."
msgstr "电调应通过 CAN 分线板串联连接，然后用一根 4 芯 CAN 线连接到飞控的 CAN 端口。注意最后一个分线板的一侧有终端电阻（即无端口）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:46
#: 9b59c31e9f774932b1ed4080169e051e
msgid ""
"If using a Cube autopilot, the CAN1 and CAN2 labels are reversed.  These "
"instructions assume the ESCs are connected to the CAN1 port which is "
"labelled \"CAN2\" on Cube autopilots"
msgstr "如果使用 Cube 飞控，CAN1 和 CAN2 标签是反的。这些说明假设电调连接到 CAN1 端口，在 Cube 飞控上标注为「CAN2」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:52
#: 1eeda844f00d4eed9a41c48c20f04200
msgid ""
"Set the dip switches on each ESC to specify its unique number.  This "
"number also maps the ESC to an equivalent PWM output on the back of the "
"autopilot.  For example ESC 1 will react just like a normal PWM ESC "
"connected to the autopilot's MAIN OUT 1.  By default this mapping also "
"matches the :ref:`motor order diagrams <Copter:connect-escs-and-motors>`."
msgstr ""
"在每个电调上设置拨码开关以指定其唯一编号。该编号同时将电调映射到飞控背面对应的 PWM 输出。例如，电调 1 的响应与连接到飞控 MAIN OUT"
" 1 的普通 PWM 电调相同。默认情况下，此映射也与 :ref:`电机顺序图 <Copter:connect-escs-and-motors>`"
" 匹配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:53
#: 89a11ae7a6e342f2bd555314540f97c8
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 3 (ToshibaCAN)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 3（ToshibaCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:54
#: eafb19f9337849a88a4abb6fa858c71e
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First driver) to specify "
"that the ESCs are connected to the CAN1 port"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（第一驱动器），以指定电调连接到 CAN1 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:56
#: a11f5ce76f0e4b5eb372160ec875470d
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` = 1000 and :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX "
"<MOT_PWM_MAX>` = 2000 so ArduPilot uses an output range that matches the "
"ESCs input range"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` = 1000 和 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX "
"<MOT_PWM_MAX>` = 2000，使 ArduPilot 的输出范围与电调的输入范围匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:62
#: a3f001145e5c4ce3b1ff4e2a2ca10567
msgid "Logging and Reporting"
msgstr "日志记录与报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:64
#: dfc39d8572c142ebbfdb52955bd0615e
msgid ""
"ToshibaCAN ESCs provide information back to the autopilot which is "
"recorded in the autopilot's onboard log's ESCn messages and can be viewed"
" in any :ref:`ArduPilot compatible log viewer <common-logs>`.  This "
"information includes:"
msgstr ""
"ToshibaCAN 电调向飞控反馈信息，记录在飞控机载日志的 ESCn 消息中，可通过任何 :ref:`ArduPilot 兼容日志查看器 "
"<common-logs>` 查看。这些信息包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:66
#: 98e0ab4b2c2849b0b4ff5e74b3d623f0
msgid "RPM"
msgstr "转速"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:67
#: f50017533f44405eb3bf1eb590f2dab5
msgid "Voltage"
msgstr "电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:68
#: d0af0b68bd2d4ed5ada0ccee131b1ba8
msgid "Current"
msgstr "电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:69
#: 44ea6722814c4790975d164cbc8fbf84
msgid "ESC Temperature"
msgstr "电调温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:70
#: a4c47a232aad460ea38bec71837360f7
msgid "Total Current"
msgstr "总电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:71
#: 62133813dcee4d639519ed163cbb8028
msgid "Motor Temperature (if the optional motor temperature sensor is connected)"
msgstr "电机温度（如果连接了可选的电机温度传感器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:73
#: e7fa938fb14e49ae9bb44d444a230c36
msgid ""
"The RCOU messages are also written to the onboard logs which hold the "
"requested output level sent to the ESCs expressed as a number from 1000 "
"(meaning stopped) to 2000 (meaning full output)."
msgstr "RCOU 消息也会写入机载日志，记录发送给电调的请求输出级别，表示为 1000（停止）到 2000（全功率）之间的数字。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:75
#: 410960dcdb454336806815745c1f2e6f
msgid ""
"This information (except the motor temperature) can also be viewed in "
"real-time using a ground station.  If using the Mission Planner go to the"
" Flight Data screen's status tab and look for esc1_rpm."
msgstr "这些信息（电机温度除外）也可通过地面站实时查看。如果使用 Mission Planner，转到飞行数据界面的状态标签页，查找 esc1_rpm。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-toshiba-can-escs.rst:83
#: 92c05dfb51c14083816d14b203c8135a
msgid ""
"Sending ESC data to the GCS requires using MAVLink2.  Please check the "
"appropriate SERIALx_PROTOCOL parameter is 2 (where \"x\" is the serial "
"port number used for the telemetry connection)."
msgstr ""
"向地面站发送电调数据需要使用 MAVLink2。请检查相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数是否为 "
"2（其中「x」是用于数传连接的串口编号）。"

